        p(data-l10n-id="summary_text") Staff / Lead Software Engineer in Amsterdam (26+ years, ex-AWS) with deep frontend expertise and broad full-stack background. Hands-on across architecture, design systems, React/Next.js, Node.js and platform infrastructure. At DataSnipper built frontend deployment platform (&lt;20 min from idea to browser-testable env) and led frontend guild; implemented agentic workflows for the platform — skills-based knowledge base from 100+ repos and parallel agents on worktrees. Speaker & GitNation org. committee.

